    "answer": {
      "short": "The median is $1$. Correct answer: B.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(X\\leq 0)&=0.4\\\\P(X\\leq 1)&=0.4+0.2\\\\&=0.6\\end{align*}$$\nThe cumulative probability first reaches or exceeds $0.5$ at $X=1$, so the median is $1$.\n\nCorrect answer: B.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
